<Slide style={{
  width: '1280px', height: '720px',
  background: '#FAF7F2', padding: '40px 60px 20px',
  flexDirection: 'column',
}}>
  {/* A 标题区 */}
  <Box style={{ marginBottom: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 4 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#8B1A1A', borderRadius: 6, padding: '4px 10px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#fff' }}>核心概念</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>第一章 · 机会数</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2B2B2B' }}>
      什么是<span style={{ color: '#8B1A1A' }}>"下听"</span>？
    </Text>
  </Box>
  {/* B 内容区 - 非对称双栏 60:40 */}
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, flex: 1, height: 500 }}>
    {/* 左侧 SVG 牌例演变图 60% */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 6, background: '#FFFEF8', borderRadius: 16, padding: 24, border: '1px solid #eee4d2', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
      {/* 状态1：还没听牌 */}
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#6B6B6B' }}>① 还没听牌（还差好几张）</Text>
        <svg width={580} height={70} viewBox="0 0 580 70">
          <rect x="10" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFFEF8" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="34" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">3</text>
          <text x="34" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">万</text>
          <rect x="62" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFFEF8" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="86" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">4</text>
          <text x="86" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">万</text>
          <rect x="114" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFFEF8" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="138" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">8</text>
          <text x="138" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">万</text>
          <rect x="166" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFFEF8" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="190" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">2</text>
          <text x="190" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">条</text>
          <rect x="218" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFFEF8" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="242" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">7</text>
          <text x="242" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">条</text>
          <rect x="270" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFFEF8" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="294" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">9</text>
          <text x="294" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">条</text>
          <rect x="322" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFFEF8" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="346" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#C0392B">1</text>
          <text x="346" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#C0392B">筒</text>
          <rect x="374" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFFEF8" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="398" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#C0392B">5</text>
          <text x="398" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#C0392B">筒</text>
          <rect x="426" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFFEF8" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="450" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#C0392B">5</text>
          <text x="450" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#C0392B">筒</text>
          <rect x="478" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFFEF8" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="502" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#C0392B">8</text>
          <text x="502" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#C0392B">筒</text>
          <rect x="530" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFFEF8" stroke="#D8CBB4" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="554" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#C0392B">9</text>
          <text x="554" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#C0392B">筒</text>
        </svg>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8a7a5f' }}>13张散牌，还差好几张才能成"4组+1对"的结构</Text>
      </Box>
      {/* 箭头 */}
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ background: '#8B1A1A', borderRadius: 8, padding: '8px 16px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#fff' }}>进一张有用的牌 →</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#C9A227', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>比如进 3万 → 凑成 345万顺子</Text>
      </Box>
      {/* 状态2：听牌了 */}
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A7F5C' }}>② 听牌了！（只差一张就胡）</Text>
        <svg width={580} height={70} viewBox="0 0 580 70">
          {/* 345万 - 顺子1 */}
          <rect x="10" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#F0FBF5" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="34" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">3</text>
          <text x="34" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">万</text>
          <rect x="62" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#F0FBF5" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="86" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">4</text>
          <text x="86" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">万</text>
          <rect x="114" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#F0FBF5" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="138" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">5</text>
          <text x="138" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">万</text>
          {/* 8万 - 顺子2 */}
          <rect x="170" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#F0FBF5" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="194" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">8</text>
          <text x="194" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">万</text>
          {/* 279条 - 顺子3 */}
          <rect x="230" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#F0FBF5" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="254" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">2</text>
          <text x="254" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">条</text>
          <rect x="282" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#F0FBF5" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="306" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">7</text>
          <text x="306" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">条</text>
          <rect x="334" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#F0FBF5" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="358" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">9</text>
          <text x="358" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">条</text>
          {/* 55筒 - 将（对子） */}
          <rect x="394" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#F0FBF5" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="418" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#C0392B">5</text>
          <text x="418" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#C0392B">筒</text>
          <rect x="446" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#F0FBF5" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <text x="470" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#C0392B">5</text>
          <text x="470" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#C0392B">筒</text>
          {/* 听牌位 - 8筒9筒搭子 */}
          <rect x="506" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFF5F0" stroke="#8B1A1A" strokeWidth="2.5" />
          <text x="530" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#C0392B">8</text>
          <text x="530" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#C0392B">筒</text>
          <rect x="558" y="8" width="48" height="56" rx="6" fill="#FFF5F0" stroke="#8B1A1A" strokeWidth="2.5" />
          <text x="582" y="36" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#C0392B">9</text>
          <text x="582" y="54" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#C0392B">筒</text>
        </svg>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8a7a5f' }}>3组顺子 + 55筒将 + 89筒搭子 →</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8B1A1A' }}>听 7筒！这就是"听牌"</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    {/* 右侧文字解释 40% */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 4, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#F5EDE0', borderRadius: 12, padding: 20, borderLeft: '4px solid #8B1A1A' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8B1A1A', marginBottom: 8 }}>三个术语一次说清</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4a4038', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2B2B2B' }}>听牌</span> = 手牌只差一张就能胡了<br />
          <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2B2B2B' }}>下听</span> = 从"还差好几张"变成"只差一张"的过程<br />
          <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8B1A1A' }}>机会数</span> = 能让你"下听"的那些牌的剩余总张数
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#FFFEF8', borderRadius: 12, padding: 20, border: '1px solid #eee4d2' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A7F5C', marginBottom: 6 }}>💡 类比理解</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4a4038', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
          想象赛跑：从"还剩 200 米"到"最后冲刺线"——<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>下听</span>就是冲过那个"最后冲刺线"的瞬间。<br /><br />
          <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8B1A1A' }}>机会数</span> 就是在终点线前数：有多少条赛道还通着、每条道上还有几个对手在跑——数字越大，你"逮到一张就冲线"的概率越高。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(201,162,39,0.08)', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, border: '1px solid #e8d8a8' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6b5636', lineHeight: 1.6, fontStyle: 'italic' }}>
          "机会数就是能够让一副牌'下听'的那些数字牌"<br />
          <span style={{ fontSize: 12, opacity: 0.7 }}>——《理论册》第 2 节 · 99 人划线</span>
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  {/* C 页脚 */}
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'flex-end', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#a0a0a0' }}>04 / 16</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
